+## Artwork verifier
+
+This repository is the canonical product host for the private
+`makeit-artwork-verifier` package. The package supplies the CLI, browser
+runtime, cases and evidence verifier. This repository owns only the
+Artwork-specific Host Adapter: the product-meaning provider, read-only
+observation bridge and production-safe wiring.
+
+Compatibility is determined by the versioned host contract in this checkout,
+never by repository name or local path. With Node.js `>=20.11 <25` and pnpm 10:
+
+```bash
+git clone <official-repository-url>
+cd fe-editor
+pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
+pnpm verify:artwork:setup
+pnpm verify:artwork:host
+```
+
+The verifier is pinned in `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml`; no prototype
+repository or Git submodule is required. Team members receive the Host Adapter
+through the normal frontend branch/merge workflow and the verifier package
+through `pnpm install`.
+
+The canonical agent skill is:
+
+```text
+agents/verify-artwork-editor/SKILL.md
+```
+
+Common commands:
+
+```bash
+pnpm verify:artwork:capabilities
+pnpm verify:artwork:run --case <request.json>
+pnpm verify:artwork:run --suite representative
+```
+
+Verification seams require the explicit non-production verification flag and
+remain unavailable in production builds. Generated requests, evidence and
+reports are local-only under `artwork-editor-verification/`.
