+ *    decorative placeholder canvas through a live Konva Image (supervisor R2);
+ *  - a tested source with no canvas-backed raster node is `pending`;
+ *  - an ambiguous raster node set is `failed` / `ambiguous-raster-node`;
+ *  - a single non-canvas drawable is unusable (`non-canvas-raster-source`);
+ *  - a unique canvas-backed raster node is ready for acquisition.
